fereg bundles the Rust crate fereg-core (MIT, Leo Liu) and the crates.io
dependencies listed in src/rust/Cargo.lock. Their authors and licenses:

- extendr-api, extendr-ffi, extendr-macros: the extendr authors (MIT)
- faer and its dependencies (faer-traits, pulp, gemm, ...): Sarah El Kazdadi and contributors (MIT)
- rayon, rayon-core: Josh Stone, Niko Matsakis and contributors (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
- approx-chol: its authors (MIT)
- other transitive dependencies: see each crate's Cargo.toml in src/rust/vendor.tar.xz
